---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Bald Eagle Youth Soccer">
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-overlay">
            <img src="/beyslogo.png" class="hero-logo" alt="BEYS Logo">
            <h1>Bald Eagle Youth Soccer</h1>
            <p>Building Skills. Building Confidence. Building Community.</p>
            <div class="hero-buttons">
                <a class="register-btn"
                    href="https://login.stacksports.com/login?client_id=612b0399b1854a002e427f78&redirect_uri=https://core-api.bluesombrero.com/login/redirect/portal/6317&app_name=Bald+Eagle+Youth+Soccer&portalid=6317&instancekey=sports"
                    target="_blank"
                    aria-label="Register Now (opens in a new tab)">
                    Register Now
                </a>
                <a class="field-btn" href="/fields">
                    Field Locations
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PROGRAMS -->
    <section id="programs" class="programs">
        <h2>Our Programs</h2>
        <div class="program-grid">
            <div class="program-card">
                <h3>U6</h3>
                <p>Practice Tues & Thurs</p>
                <p>6:00–7:00 PM</p>
                <p class="games">In-house games Thursday nights</p>
            </div>
            <div class="program-card">
                <h3>U8</h3>
                <p>Practice Tues & Thurs</p>
                <p>6:00–7:30 PM</p>
                <p class="games">Games Saturdays 9:30 AM</p>
            </div>
            <div class="program-card">
                <h3>U10</h3>
                <p>Practice Tues & Thurs</p>
                <p>6:00–7:30 PM</p>
                <p class="games">Games Saturdays 11:00 AM</p>
            </div>
            <div class="program-card">
                <h3>U13</h3>
                <p>Practice Tues & Thurs</p>
                <p>6:00–7:30 PM</p>
                <p class="games">Games Saturdays 12:30 PM</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
    </section>

    <!-- ANNOUNCEMENTS -->
    <section class="announcements">
        <h2>Important Announcements</h2>
        <div class="announcement-cards">
      
  <!-- SUMMER SKILLS CAMP -->
  <div class="announcement">

    <img src="/soccerplayer.png" class="announcement-icon" alt="Soccer Camp">
  
    <span class="tag">Summer Camp</span>
  
    <h3>⚽ Thank You for a Great Soccer Skills Camp!</h3>

   

    <p>
        Thank you to all of the players, families, coaches, volunteers, and Bald Eagle Area varsity players who joined us for our BEYS Soccer Skills Camp!
    </p>

    <p>
        We had a fantastic morning of skill-building, games, teamwork, and fun while helping our young athletes grow their love for the game.
    </p>

    <p>
        A special thank you to everyone who helped organize and run the camp, including our varsity coaches and players, Coach Mike, Coach Will, Coach Joe, and Randi Rossi for leading our referee training.
    </p>

    <div class="fundraiser-thankyou">
        Thank You for Making Our Camp a Success! 🦅⚽
    </div>

  </div>
  
  <div class="announcement">

    <img src="/soccerball.png" class="announcement-icon" alt="Fall 2026 Soccer Season">
    <span class="tag">Fall 2026 Season</span>

    <h3>FALL 2026 Registration Is Closed — The Season Is Almost Here!</h3>

    <p>
      Registration for the Fall 2026 Bald Eagle Youth Soccer season is now closed. Thank you to all of the families who registered and are joining us this season!
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Season Begins:</strong> Tuesday, September 1, 2026 at 6:00 PM
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>All Age Groups:</strong> U6, U8, U10 &amp; U13
    </p>

    <p>
      We can't wait to see all of our players back on the field and get the Fall 2026 season underway!
    </p>

    <p>
      Questions about the upcoming season? Contact us at baldeagleyouthsoccer@gmail.com.
    </p>

</div>
  <div class="announcement">

    <img src="/sponsor.png" class="announcement-icon" alt="Sponsor BEYS">
  
    <span class="tag">Sponsors</span>
  
    <h3>Support BEYS This Fall</h3>
  
    <p>
      Bald Eagle Youth Soccer is preparing sponsorship opportunities for the Fall 2026 season and is looking forward to partnering with local businesses and community supporters.
    </p>
  
    <p>
      Sponsorship options will include opportunities ranging from league donations to full team sponsorships.
    </p>
  
    <p>
      Depending on the sponsorship level, businesses can receive recognition on team jerseys, field signage, and be promoted on the BEYS website.
    </p>
  
    <p>
      Every contribution helps support our players, equipment, field improvements, and youth soccer programs throughout the community.
    </p>
  
    <p>
      Additional details and sponsorship information will be announced soon as we finalize our sponsorship packages.
    </p>
    <a href="/sponsors" class="announcement-btn">
      Become a Sponsor →
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="announcement">

    <img src="/beyslogo.png" class="announcement-icon" alt="BEYS Logo">
  
    <span class="tag">Community</span>
  
    <h3>Thank You for a Great Spring Season</h3>
  
    <p>
      Thank you to all of our players, families, coaches, volunteers, sponsors, referees, and supporters who helped make our Spring 2026 season a success.
    </p>
  
    <p>
      Your time, effort, and enthusiasm help make Bald Eagle Youth Soccer a special place for our community and players.
    </p>
  
    <p>
      We hope everyone enjoys their summer and we look forward to seeing you back on the fields this fall! ⚽🦅
    </p>
  
  </div>
    </section>
    <section id="junior-high-soccer">
        <h2>Continuing the Soccer Journey</h2>
        <p>As part of the BEYS mission, we encourage players to continue developing their love for soccer beyond youth league play. </br>Sixth grade families interested in Junior High Soccer can join using the SportsYou codes below:</p>
        
        <div class="program-grid">
          <div class="program-card">
            <h3>Girls Junior High Soccer</h3>
            <p><strong>Code:</strong> RNUA-LRKK</p>
          </div>
          <div class="program-card">
            <h3>Boys Junior High Soccer</h3>
            <p><strong>Code:</strong> Z456-5Q69</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
       
      
       
      </section>
</Layout>